{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台指東北季候風正影響廣東，本港早上氣溫稍涼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">清晨風勢清勁，市民出門上班上學都感受到涼意，要多穿外套保暖。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台指，本港早上各區氣溫普遍下降至23度左右。今日大致多雲和乾燥，日間氣溫回升至約29度。未來一兩日風勢較大，預料季候風會在本周後期至下周初稍為緩和，同時受高空反氣旋支配，廣東普遍晴朗，氣溫逐漸回升。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0800.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026aZDTxxExIj1791245617.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-0800.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T00:39:36.450409+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}